  {
   "id": "kor_for_eng:pod-0-unrecorded:SC22-S001",
   "global_order": 221,
   "english": "Would you mind if I tried to practise speaking Korean with you? I haven't been learning for very long, and I still feel a little nervous about speaking with other people.",
   "target_text": "혹시 한국어 연습을 좀 해봐도 될까요? 배운 지 얼마 안 돼서, 다른 사람들이랑 얘기하는 게 아직 좀 떨려요.",
